"Bulk AI uses the current source language, target language and search across"
" all matching pages. Prepared AI drafts are marked inside each image editor"
" and are skipped by later campaigns until reviewed or cleared."
msgstr ""
"Przetwarzanie zbiorcze z AI wykorzystuje bieżący język źródłowy, język "
